	(text "Inputs: AMP_RAW / 4.01 (R136, R137). Thresholds from VREF through\nR132 to R135, all 0.1 %; the levels at the comparators are calculated.\nWith every tolerance the over-current level is 111.4 mV to 118.7 mV at\nthe shunt and stays below the full scale of the converter, 122.9 mV.\nJump forces range 3, over-current is 1.15 A in range 3 and trips,\nstep up asks for one range up.\n\nOutputs are active high and read low without +3V3_A: PWR_GOOD covers\nthat rail. D23 keeps the comparator inputs inside VDD + 1 V when\n+3V3_A is off and AMP_RAW is high.\nAbout 3 mV of hysteresis; blanking (2 us), trip qualification (12 us)\nand latching are in the range sequencer of the controller."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "120213c6-bde1-50c2-b25d-5c65f417c920")
	)
	(text "over-current: 0.584 V, 115 mV at the shunt"
